    "content": {
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Describe the life cycle of a star that is about the same size as the Sun, starting from a main sequence star.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(4)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Main sequence star: the forces from fusion and gravity are balanced</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">When hydrogen runs out it expands to become a red giant</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">It then loses its outer layers and the core collapses to a white dwarf</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">The white dwarf cools to become a black dwarf</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
